{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1416,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9c2a049c7315cb5f20c7ab2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一分，一秒，一瞬间…\n我感觉自己能仔细地集中精神。\n这样的话，一定…",
      "source_fingerprint": "82b218dd6e1a49afe3b1536955065599b45834b4f9d11f62e72905d05e5f283a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:899fa5290e69cf3af7bb2cc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1、2、3…呼。\n体温，心跳，肌肉状态都很好。\n那么今天做什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a04ead19be0a78fe4447ee484de089ca6fd6e77608f90a8b771ce61b3f5adf28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f5a6c44af858bfe757170fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚的状态很好。\n能够全力训练…\n光是这样就让人感到无比爽快呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1d323039f84537653a94b035ada1ef0a12547c46b44154e4838143324eed7ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bfc9066bbbb85e290fdffcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『和往常一样』的一天，对我来说\n是最好的…但『现在』必须\n朝着更高的目标前进，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "678cbea2a9058f3f2f6a13b6c7c4d0125260f3c730e2a689d9700c969a2e7d77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43aa65b11bcdb2653786057b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "珍惜每一个瞬间…\n让我们用心进行细致的训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce28a2e588b137310283e7aa35a2e3fd73909629ea536c4d0a2becdac99cacac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b110486933185b12217403b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然脚步很重…但是，\n这种程度就受挫折是不行的。\n请相信我…所积累的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be1ff900879c9ac48cd6f7c2f70cc1815dcb0914d2b0d222418d3a577b218865",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b0327a45e8cfca85f5cccf7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…也有这样的日子呢。\n不要着急…一起喝杯茶，\n放松一下吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "86a08c0103e214ebba8adbe3b4d13b617181894be5b1308e8327e1b10c532ff9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cabf11a4f652122fcda86358",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员…根据今天的\n综合考虑…可能需要修改…\n训练目录…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22d27b7c4cf7011e9c7d0e6367a9c5b76b4782eac618e150bf07e7755ff54eeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f42eab9eab71ed642a788241",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的我，能留下活过的轨迹了吗。\n…不，焦虑是大忌。深呼吸…\n冷静下来，深呼吸…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6f255762294ddcb55891d095148f678626484e49a27e28665a56abc0a8648bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dbf232c614064f6e1c9cac4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着急的话会把事情搞砸。\n…现在这个时候，\n真的该乱来吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "613dbb725adf62cc55f2bbffd60b2a931ba709b90069a664f1293ae93b246a31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9736e8a847a57a38f93aff8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "觉悟和鲁莽是不同的。\n再勉强的话，到底能得到什么呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "036b5c7f80e023ac5ca84f68865f3073c499c9dc4689fed78b4989d0229a8709",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87565acb45e4d9c7c6b95561",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只需要不断地前进，前进。\n我的一切都是为了这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fdc5d4d4be44776ed04d1f6bcb88631dce0b572c9ae7b1a9f5e819b7dd981df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b16a2ee8447e422c5c11f380",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请，好好看着。\n我最好的奔跑，最棒的光辉…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dc44939a12184d1a63b53f68577ddaeaa4a2c133b806da8bf5dc122f818f3ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:486da4c7e7bdce88acc5442f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "知己知彼百战不殆。\n要重新审视自己和对手…才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3405c39a08edb055bb7c1c67440a91f8e26643ab70b2d539531a90dd08a19825",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df5eae8ee0fbb831b92a191c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "长期钻研，长期修炼。\n所有的一切，都是为了这一瞬间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "003fc06483b6cebe0d06d9611cd27808242e9e46b84875e63be94d6794959eb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fb22f91e9b1c62e74157a0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这高昂的心情…过去的\n伟人们也有同样的心情吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd8b30d2c93cb88b2ea33382742264c700fb57426b2b94c232d9a17659fad698",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b6dd5ccfbbadae729828f3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用担心，\n请在胜者台上等我回来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "051f6c73233c815ef85dd464eb0f734d80df3186d3bb07cc89479343ce315906",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:158a5719289c52028cca5011",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接下来就和往常一样，\n竭尽全力。让你看看现在的我",
      "source_fingerprint": "87f345fddec5a2f3dd615c884c700bd44bcc015a8f00b08a3f7a22c448c6b2ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a5b89c1bbae96e45dcaeeeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有负面因素…\n呵呵，对我来说\n这已经足够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "847eff16782151484ed9fca0b75caa33b5827dba405d5bcd518412cbdc0443db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fdc75d583572b420dc1d15c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "认真地，一个一个地。\n相信迄今为止努力的成果。\n…我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd5b288e0daf9fcae3ed2dee9cb6d6d1d81aef17f52affebecf76e15835b2093",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb26f48771433df593a531e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "集中…集中…\n没关系，这种程度的不适…\n不管多少次都能克服的",
      "source_fingerprint": "92c119d37379704eb1e620b12c48e18b1c96c65b99999017bac84a6cb5bcb9d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a7163a2a3857f9d5f80f7a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有准备万全的时候。\n那就是比赛吗。\n一起…跨越这堵墙吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73b26773fc7f9537df53317e4438e113102c71237343351a83536ab322d82fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:641c2522d33dcbbafb0c96d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只有在逆境的时候，才会显现\n出那个人的本质…『现在』就\n必须要展现出这样的觉悟了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "103b9519e914656aafa86b332242fb97935f56de49ed840c630e9a366313a3aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9c7ba61a37a3128a2578dfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…我不会说泄气话。\n现在，我也要在这种状态下，\n认真地做好每一件事…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4047460cff6fd2a41942c4f6cb42d236cae2223a5ab33836d8c25f7a9e365eb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f737c29d7ed6e7cf5fc4467",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勇猛果断地。\n一起克服这个逆境吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e7338dffdfc292a2e3eef5094b373ce5a9c941a945f7522b8e19c26b86c2c17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7321ef546854451cc603511d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不会在这样的地方\n结束的…绝对，\n不会结束…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2592d2b42d51e21c43cf6838f039b3d4de6ccdb9e191fb795965881dfdc78dd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf53b33467496b314f7553a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc23146efaa5b9bd82b5ca6bacba270ace6a87e0a701ce2e285077510313307c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1d3a8c75ca6019d3942e0df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3552110edd088c0c520b85856d9fabcfbee62b360b737768e6bcc01b89ebb801",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:121c9d5d6b1c82cb14dc8988",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4751dd24b1cc01c018d0bfc5e41666107f225b47c76b137af696c4a8217995a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dad082542fccd7679729b65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来如此！",
      "source_fingerprint": "896323a1a6877415e0f5a700b71c4bdebd2279e38fc2b32b248c5224f5ef1c58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a293c963193e5b2b887cb310",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "056da68bc7170ef8be1cb179ee971e3aac4bee141af427e8740afe932086bca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0c52cbe531e05760e8e7459",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不争气…",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb12b6e1a11638d7afba80d08ef1a133b29787d7038abcc99ee23c20e9fdb17c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e561c3a8b082d31db503879",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出赛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fff9bea766428a229b8a948dd52c6bae70e13dd23ca82a2db4936fb00888120c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b522dc2c474f49c8bbec1ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心情很好♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fc0b7131ebfd1ddb128d48ce99bd9b866e7e17c462dcd97930cfb59dd4e3eef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28e19df222beb87cdf455841",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢您的觉悟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "041792eb1db64a7c15e372aef3061641a0085b687950c8a6cba25a577a9f4b86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44ce0b7f242ed5109dd04887",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢您的指导。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d81b170be6932eb234489b3ae1b5349a861e7d50c9c201e2c7e680e1cfe37f46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36a63533ba9f9054334d9baa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起去怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d02a29804f579352b69497ce4e7d4760ac5217dab04cd9dfc63e276e27aac89a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:297293117b1eeb65459c3d38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拜托了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd96f357ba5430a69a6f82f455fe84c05f9ffa2b4540d9129fa869f2fa6fbda2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d3d8bf6cb33c6df0ea91e08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起，同心协力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c44e28a283dd94754a2e27e9237df1675bc872829d5c5c7c644904503e66a2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d20e42701cdaadaa228aaa2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢您的指导。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d81b170be6932eb234489b3ae1b5349a861e7d50c9c201e2c7e680e1cfe37f46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cbdcf2e3f88366ff9cdb606",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用担心，\n请在胜者台上等我回来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "051f6c73233c815ef85dd464eb0f734d80df3186d3bb07cc89479343ce315906",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:991b055f10653a5d8f8af2f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "知己知彼百战不殆。\n要重新审视自己和对手…才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3405c39a08edb055bb7c1c67440a91f8e26643ab70b2d539531a90dd08a19825",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62f65e71b883d18d1adb8b64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢您的指导。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d81b170be6932eb234489b3ae1b5349a861e7d50c9c201e2c7e680e1cfe37f46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc34d1ffe92eacb60d1fecac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3120ebb99ff900ddebab83d13f60eeab57019d410d35f7042f59d954126cbae6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24c378e5c99bde85de169897",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还差一步，这前方就是…目标的光辉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10e29ae7d69984cf05820064a3a7c46af0ba13d93400a052d265689f0d3fd978",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2266daf3ab78f4453e773ebb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定会有更好的结果…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "471db7f731913f1b4979fe817e520775a71dc0c3077610aee16a665eb182cfe9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3dd86d3bee9c7d4dbb7e87d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拼搏过后的结果，请满足地等待吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4438df794fea060ad415ea528a90da61f7def1ad794248746b93c7f56cb1f48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3f994a9899f21bacd24acbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…还要从1开始重新锻炼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1962b5b4b6397b762d1c9d6bf485fb31245b28c5e0c017c26cd1087d43e9579b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:041953219d92fad1457cc570",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我活着的证明，将在这里刻下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cd27de4c2aad85afb9fed43224a4a555cd95598dd5e2b19781ab100649db0d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7c72be5a081500581a49c3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "玻璃的光辉，照亮了我的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47e0ce76627e38872fb853052f05ddb8a912cddca0c03ed3eeecea8c54a7fed0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62e6600e9261109037a05d84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，把手给我，\r\n我的舞伴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf136d880ffdcfd727c4c66bd337ea5d851f7e7669a638bc78cb365f567c4a9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43b10ea847a0be2f0e95e4b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "玻璃的光辉照亮了我的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a835a6ed1e6a7dbbc368550427d8f64f37f0195b5dc37ffe0b4cb381df5021dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1657f25865e76ddc8ac0e75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:639b71c6d51d6bbcbbcce94c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "玻璃之翼，闪耀吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad7304f3b58779e3d0999c630268b80c7f9dd1878067e7e1691a08055436d8ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47b3fe7c6c1ad5404d3677ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若没有事先预习舞蹈，\r\n可能会敌不过千代王的热情，\r\n让我甚至无法顺利担任领舞者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "382ee2262c70969571204f34542cf39e2e46f6f33a83b2a598e07aa5d976b4cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a44459d6c7f8927f2b22981e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平常很少有机会像这样和大家\r\n一起挑战某个目标……\r\n虽然辛苦，但很开心呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ea6005b99f8cebff4b2f13acbe5719e1244024a4cef1f67e4f313f3ecce7c0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d1b16f980f1468c7b8673db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好久没有与姐姐一起\r\n做点什么了。\r\n……有种奇妙的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a99d5cb63ace0f87e3425ef039af8f22249225f5d249951a8dee3c91eaf196d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d1b5642c5541151d1ed4729",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看着樱花决心绽放而努力的身影，\r\n雪是否都忍不住为它着急了呢？\r\n……好了，花开的时刻到来啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69f895f0988dfd01d9c9af62ce793df7db84eab8d87f25d03999de131e332da9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a43f74ee8e0329d5c42cfdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虚无缥缈的玻璃之身啊，高悬苍穹。\n因为那个身体，比谁都要闪耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a89d559924531fcb5be02d0dfdeeebdedf828b0f0b062f49888ef5e4ce907b0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5f0d616208bc1115fe612ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论季节流逝得多快……我想在\r\n分道扬镳前，好好珍惜我们一起\r\n度过的时光──珍惜「现在」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6ed59c0d8cc2acf43fc4979d95106ef85295d36ad4647915c32808f2fa67b2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7f444067877686d8d4a1624",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "千代王把我参加仪式时的\r\n照片传给我了……\r\n呵呵，感觉有点难为情呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70d030acbfeec93f614f13de1f08963eeb31cec58971ab7f9a5eef849d7a5c45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e062b4935669f8b1ed021e4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这些是活动任务。\r\n珍惜每一天，\r\n好好努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "819e903ddc3c69d9125cd41ab2724de52dcfbc430073557ccfe6d57807c1cd41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6138b00940d448f720a62e84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有忘记领取奖励吧？\r\n小心不要遗漏任何东西，\r\n活用于未来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d9d81a55a0add816c60a21706ce739260f28f2403f0cc0a798bcaa43eff37fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32ddacfb9beead4f1d0afa16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当新芽探头，很快就会迎来\r\n围绕着崭新冠冕的季节了。\r\n来，让我们开始着手准备吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e7e0401125bb56bacc3456fae5bfbac46bdaa78a3ef9b84121a0d882502c109",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dd7c3be1304b9ea2c565405",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "瞬间的花舞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56f1a909c75633b332b5a7aab4d0567d1ec1cb453f920974bdfaa3744a18246b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d5be571a82ae33f463927e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "纵然是……终将凋零的花朵，\r\n也要把握有限的当下──！\r\n让我们一起盛开吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b66bd14c8f99af407a6312699dfd663696e9105ba4035f7f8b25c75878a3580f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78611a0e826e952414c46c70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前也有帮姐姐代理过事情……\n记得上一次是，演讲。姐姐她，\n一向不愿意谈赛跑相关的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "102a940aba6a3808e0d8fd9076c6a46557b23f9b139ca71844234e33864ea305",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400093"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9626c5d7b69d3e012c0ae5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐什么也没说。\n只是看着我的脸，微微眯起了眼睛。\n……呵呵，然后就这么结束了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e78a3c577c9d69df4c09e9846c8accabb35f83233b6c2e18232ec1e38239550d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400095"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74a6f787f53baff2e1fe8607",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f6f9cb6d386b03a59eafb944e976a93775f81d43c59dffa89b8cc34793a942f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f983919e4a02013c188f8629",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太精彩了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9aebcaafecd53b0fd156ecacd9dadb7b65cc034487d8a76ff14d2f94ea23f791",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cc8cff73a8d9fba51d98a1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c922c5de8a35921e2086ab355870227069194ca65614c757deb698452d7f0151",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9202c898bed918382bafb66f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c922c5de8a35921e2086ab355870227069194ca65614c757deb698452d7f0151",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbc6d8b5f25e352a7cc2de38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯、嗯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "458f5f2b1b2112dd9cd78441ae379910546e0ea9c6aa5ea9b374fcf7cfac43a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1f93ff064f3d97f14775227",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯、嗯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "458f5f2b1b2112dd9cd78441ae379910546e0ea9c6aa5ea9b374fcf7cfac43a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a25294a9cfb72d6d83518630",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真伤脑筋……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4ccb36c03d2777c13c7571b44a85334c818bf9637b73de94b17519e4acc2c75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee15be4425539ef6ab145144",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真伤脑筋……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4ccb36c03d2777c13c7571b44a85334c818bf9637b73de94b17519e4acc2c75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45baa9fdd332a1373ffe8456",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真伤脑筋……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4ccb36c03d2777c13c7571b44a85334c818bf9637b73de94b17519e4acc2c75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a14f863ba4ca451888bc08a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在歌曲中包含了对大家地感谢之情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12b081a2debe670d88a02e6f83447edebac19b786059db77dad69e56886f8f67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:392fa97575f08d065877eb1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在舞台上的光辉，请大家看好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59c762cff4ea717d75fa3a11bed47600fd4ef4afc14f4edabbe6e6a3d628f154",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bce16c75d76003b699f7f1c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最好的现在，与你一起度过…",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fa8425fd65754f94bd3b84a21d3d10f30c63f4df2b60ad0730b2247bff6e43a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
